Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 16:32:20 +0200
Subject: Fix GHSA-9f67-6fw4-hpfp

Reject Windows reserved device names (CON, NUL, COM1, ...) used as a path
component in filesystem operations. Bare device names and DOS device
paths keep working.

